{
  "workspace": "sylius",
  "root": "testdata/sylius",
  "description": "Sylius-Standard v2.3.1 (Symfony 7, Doctrine ORM, API Platform, Symfony UX) with a full vendor/; the app's src/ holds the entity overrides, the rest of the code lives in vendor/sylius/sylius and the Sylius plugins; fetched with `make reference-apps`",
